<title>UK: London silver fixes firmer on positive charts.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes firmer on positive charts.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 521.75 cents vs 516.95 cents on Friday.</p>
<p>Technically positive but fairly quiet with New York closed for holiday. 530-cent target.</p>
<p>GOLD - Steady at around $344.00 following fund buying Friday.</p>
<p>Australian producer selling absorbed early.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down $1.00, steady at $364.00/$365.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also down $1.00 at $133.00/$134.00.</p>
</text>
